earch  experiment caleb and maeve will later  discover this human version has gone  crazy in the barn and maeve says this  really interesting line and she may have  been human  she wasn't like any human i've ever seen  could hale have done something to her in  this quote-unquote experiment i can't  really show it because a lot of my  videos have been getting age restricted  recently but there's this close-up shot  of the blackest blood i've ever seen  oozing out of anastasia's head it rides  that fine line of is it real blood or  something else but before she dies  anastasia invites them to the opening  night of mozart's don giovanni because a  quote old friend is anxious for a  reunion this old friend seems to be  guiding these two along to a secret  entrance of delos's next park where when  asked for their reservation they've  already been inputted into the system as  mr and mrs morgan this is the delos  headquarters in san francisco they  actually used a duplicate shot from the  first episode of season 3 here i see you  trying to save money hbo deputy  assistant attorney general for  counter-terrorism jim navarro has  arrived from the justice department  requesting a meeting with the head of  delos however he's stonewalled by  clementine who now seems to be working  for the company the ceo here is referred  to as a he and my best guess is that  this is referring to william as ceo with  hale secretly pulling the strings  christina wakes up in the exact same  pose as last episode and also that of  season 1 suggesting once again that she  is in a loop and doesn't know it we  learn from peter's obituary an obituary  i may add does not have a date of birth  on it that he had donated all his money  to the hope center for mental health but  when christina visits this place she  discovers the peter meyer's wing has  been there for decades and is being torn  down i can see two explanations for this  one christina has been in a loop for  decades similar to the one delores 